  "details": "Screenshot 1. \n\nThere are two Missing Strings within the Inventory \"Cosmetics\" and \"Show 29 more\" causing them to lack translation when the preferred language is set to something other than English.\n\nScreenshot 2. \n\nThere is a Missing String within the User Interface Settings called \"Backgrounds have been moved to the Cosmetics Section in Inventory\" which causes a lack of translation.\n\nScreenshot 3 & 4.\n\nMissing Strings \"Instance successfully renamed\" and \"Instance display name cleared\" causing no translation.\n\nScreenshot 5 & 6.\n\nMissing Strings \"Uploaded\" and \"Recent\" on the Wing Menu's Avatar Section causing the text to be in English no matter the Preferred Language.\n\nScreenshot 7, 8, 9, 10.\n\nMissing Strings for all Clock related Presets/Types (34 Missing Strings) therefore currently having no translation.",
